@startuml
title Вариант 2: основная доставка через workflow
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
autonumber
participant "Банковский сервис" as Bank
participant "API + Relay" as API
database "Critical Ledger" as DB
participant "Temporal Service\nи HA persistence" as T
participant "Workflow Worker" as WF
participant "Channel Activity" as A
participant "Policy Service" as Policy
participant "Push provider" as Push
actor "Приложение" as App
participant "Receipt Receiver\nи Signal Relay" as R
Bank -> API: Событие из bank outbox
API -> DB: TX: unique key + notification + start outbox
DB --> API: Sync commit
API --> Bank: 202 + notification ID
API -> T: StartWorkflow(ID = notification ID), из outbox
T --> API: Started / already exists
T -> WF: Workflow task (после poll)
WF -> T: Schedule push activity + durable ACK timer
T -> A: Activity task (после poll)
A -> Policy: Актуальное разрешение
Policy --> A: Permit
A -> DB: Preflight + стабильный attempt ID
DB --> A: Разрешено
A -> Push: Send(notification ID, attempt ID)
Push --> A: Accepted + provider ID
A -> DB: Записать результат
A -> T: Activity result
Push -> App: Push
App -> R: Authenticated ACK
R -> DB: TX: receipt inbox + DELIVERED + signal outbox
DB --> R: Commit
R --> App: 200
R -> T: Receipt Signal; надёжный повтор из outbox
T -> WF: Signal task
WF -> T: Complete workflow; timer больше не запускает fallback
note over DB,A: При задержке Signal следующая activity\nвсё равно увидит DELIVERED в ledger
@enduml
